  "about": {
    "eyebrow": "— About",
    "title": "The designer behind the work",
    "heading": "Design isn't decoration. It's how a brand talks.",
    "p1": "I'm a graphic designer from Dhaka with a journalism background — which means I think about who's reading, not just how it looks. At PsyCoach Bangladesh I turn brand ideas into social media that actually gets engagement.",
    "p2": "Every piece starts with one question: what should this make someone feel, or do? Then I build it clean and sharp. When it doesn't hold attention, I redo it. No egos, just results.",
